nitiation of our corporate restructuring and their respective designated affiliates became ZKH Group Limited’s shareholders in December 2021 through a distribution of ZKH Group Limited’s shares in proportion to ZKH Industrial Supply’s previous shareholding structure.","context":"ZKH Group Limited was incorporated in the Cayman Islands as our holding company in April 2021. In May 2021, ZKH Group Limited established a wholly owned subsidiary, ZKH Holdings Limited, in the British Virgin Islands. Shortly after its incorporation, ZKH Holdings Limited established a wholly owned subsidiary in Hong Kong, namely, ZKH Hong Kong Limited, which is our intermediary holding company in Hong Kong.","section":"ITEM 4.INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":742,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048107","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001862044","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1862044/000110465926048107/zkh-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/6b17521e6a694c76d3d5a6bd52031031bd1cabbd83d2a20aa9dd5b8df33d0011.bin","sha256":"6b17521e6a694c76d3d5a6bd52031031bd1cabbd83d2a20aa9dd5b8df33d0011"}},{"id":"d59409fa0a7e39ab81c08d7d585350780c4992a707c6f51896e0af08aad87d21","quote":"Following the completion of our corporate restructuring in September 2022, ZKH Industrial Supply became a wholly owned subsidiary of ZKH Hong Kong Limited. We expect to continue operating a majority of our business in China through ZKH Industrial Supply and its subsidiaries.","context":"ZKH Industrial Supply completed several rounds of equity financing since its inception. As a part of our corporate restructuring, the then existing shareholders of ZKH Industrial Supply immediately prior to the initiation of our corporate restructuring and their respective designated affiliates became ZKH Group Limited’s shareholders in December 2021 through a distribution of ZKH Group Limited’s shares in proportion to ZKH Industrial Supply’s previous shareholding structure.","section":"ITEM 4.INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":743,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048107","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001862044","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1862044/000110465926048107/zkh-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/6b17521e6a694c76d3d5a6bd52031031bd1cabbd83d2a20aa9dd5b8df33d0011.bin","sha256":"6b17521e6a694c76d3d5a6bd52031031bd1cabbd83d2a20aa9dd5b8df33d0011"}},{"id":"ee43d442e8407f5b6bee4dcaa8d8672cc55b49b68070f97cecc96edf7b32e0a1","quote":"On December 15, 2023, our ADSs commenced trading on NYSE under the symbol “ZKH.” We raised an aggregate of US$53.3 million in net proceeds from our initial public offering and the underwriters’ partial exercise of their option to purchase additional ADSs after deducting underwriting commissions and the offering expenses payable by us.","context":"Following the completion of our corporate restructuring in September 2022, ZKH Industrial Supply became a wholly owned subsidiary of ZKH Hong Kong Limited. We expect to continue operating a majority of our business in China through ZKH Industrial Supply and its subsidiaries.","section":"ITEM 4.INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":744,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048107","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001862044","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1862044/000110465926048107/zkh-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/6b17521e6a694c76d3d5a6bd52031031bd1cabbd83d2a20aa9dd5b8df33d0011.bin","sha256":"6b17521e6a694c76d3d5a6bd52031031bd1cabbd83d2a20aa9dd5b8df33d0011"}},{"id":"72f4dbf1378b88ab6b4dbfa736abb0866592018ab97e00db5b7ed92cb9ae10f5","quote":