Changes in China’s economic, political or social conditions or government policies could have a material adverse effect on our business, financial conditions and results of operations.","block":207,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048107","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001862044","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1862044/000110465926048107/zkh-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/6b17521e6a694c76d3d5a6bd52031031bd1cabbd83d2a20aa9dd5b8df33d0011.bin","sha256":"6b17521e6a694c76d3d5a6bd52031031bd1cabbd83d2a20aa9dd5b8df33d0011"}},{"id":"4b435ae2e009193201b100947cb0d3790408de35a980913d902aff1ec436e8f2","quote":"●Our ADSs may be prohibited from trading in the United States under the HFCAA in the future if the PCAOB is unable to inspect or investigate completely auditors located in China. The delisting of the ADSs, or the threat of their being delisted, may materially and adversely affect the value of your investment.","context":"●The PCAOB had historically been unable to inspect our auditor in relation to their audit work performed for our financial statements and the inability of the PCAOB to conduct inspections of our auditor in the past has deprived our investors with the benefits of such inspections.","section":"●Changes in China’s economic, political or social conditions or government policies could have a material adverse effect on our business, financial conditions and results of operations.","block":208,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048107","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001862044","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1862044/000110465926048107/zkh-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/6b17521e6a694c76d3d5a6bd52031031bd1cabbd83d2a20aa9dd5b8df33d0011.bin","